sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box rgba(31, 67, 77, 0.35) Rephora Mobile Client
        participant App as Flutter App
    end

    box rgba(34, 66, 41, 0.35) Spring Boot Monolith
        participant API as GraphQL API
        participant Consumer as Aggregation Consumer
    end

    box rgba(90, 63, 30, 0.30) AWS Messaging
        participant SNS as SNS update-aggregations
        participant SQS as SQS update-aggregations
    end

    box rgba(77, 57, 98, 0.22) DynamoDB Aggregates
        participant DB as DynamoDB tables
    end

    rect rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.07)
        Note over App,DB: In-session progress sync keeps aggregate writes out of the request path
        App->>API: syncSessionProgress(sessionId, attempts)
        API->>DB: study-sessions: append new attempts
        API->>SNS: Publish EndStudySessionMessage
        SNS->>SQS: Fan out raw payload to one durable queue
        API-->>App: Progress accepted
    end

    rect rgba(224, 169, 109, 0.08)
        Note over SQS,DB: Scheduled async worker updates learning aggregates
        Consumer->>SQS: Scheduled poll
        SQS-->>Consumer: Aggregation message
        Consumer->>DB: questions: attempts, scoreSum, correctCount
        Consumer->>DB: quizzes: aggregate attempts and score
        Consumer->>DB: books: aggregate attempts and score when linked
    end
